The class DefaultRespCommandsDataProvider is internal, so I cannot access it directly in the test. Also, the IStreamProvider interface is in the Garnet.common namespace, so I need to use that in the test. I will rewrite the test to use reflection to create an instance of DefaultRespCommandsDataProvider<TData> since it has a private constructor and is internal. I will also add the missing using for System.Text.Json for JsonException. I will submit the corrected test now. 

